# office.plan -- a sample plan for the SLeeLa AutoCAD Renderer.
#
# Description, dimensions, plan, and notes in one line-oriented file. The
# renderer (cad/render.sleela) evaluates these directives into geometry and
# emits an AutoCAD DXF drawing. See FORMAT.md for the full directive table.

title Office Floor — preliminary
units mm

# Rooms (name W H), each placed at the current insertion point.
at   0 0
room Lobby 6000 4000

at   6000 0
room Office 4000 4000

# A 900 mm door opening on the shared wall.
door 6000 1500 900

# Dimensions (x1 y1 x2 y2): overall width, and lobby depth.
dim  0 -600 10000 -600
dim  -600 0 -600 4000

# Notes / annotations.
note Fire exit on north wall
note All dimensions in millimetres
